# Phase 24 Plan 07 (R5, D-07): built by meta/buildSteamBridgeShims.ts at
# packaging time -- never committed (mirrors the other binaries above).
# steam_api.pdb / steam_api_shim.lib are zig cc -shared's own debug-symbol
# and import-library byproducts of the steam_api.dll compile gate.
# Updated 2026-09-01 (quick-260901-kl2, todo item 6): buildSteamBridgeShims.ts
# now unlinks steam_api.pdb and steam_api_shim.lib immediately after the
# compile gate passes (pruneShimBuildByproducts()), so neither should ever be
# present on disk. The rules below stay as belt-and-braces only, so a future
# toolchain change that re-emits them mid-build cannot be silently committed.
**/steam-bridge-helper
**/steam_api.dll
**/steam_api.pdb
**/steam_api_shim.lib
**/steam_appid.txt
